"]','','{\"1\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"2\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"3\": {\"answer\": \"√21\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4\": {\"answer\": \"4 | 1:3\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5\": {\"answer\": \"(4,0)\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"8\": {\"answer\": \"15/4≤CQ≤12\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-31 21:34:00','2026-08-01 02:34:00','published','2026-07-07 08:33:30','2026-07-10 01:59:05',84),(42,20,'第1课——国际音标元音 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/defa81fd3e0845588fa3fe78da675c85.pdf\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/00300bf6554845edba0342841daf6004.docx\"]','','{\"2(1)\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(2)\": {\"answer\": \"A\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(3)\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(4)\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(5)\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(1)\": {\"answer\": \"1 5 6 8 9 12 13 14 15 18 19 24\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(2)\": {\"answer\": \"a; an; a; a; an; an\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-13 21:00:00','2026-07-14 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:36:59','2026-07-08 15:51:38',57),(43,20,'第2课——国际音标辅音 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/883df174d6884a889355ff89d15454a5.pdf\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/60c1449961e74613b3e295c2c9073d6d.docx\"]','','{\"1(1)\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(12)\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(3)\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(4)\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(1)\": {\"answer\": \"1;2;2;3;3;2;1\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(2)\": {\"answer\": \"1) writing\\n2) cutting---cut (不规则动词)； \\tbeginning\\t---began; \\twaiting---waited;\\n  preferring---preferred;\\t\\t\\toccurring---occurred;\\t\\tlistening---listened\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-14 21:00:00','2026-07-15 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:37:04','2026-07-08 15:54:23',60),(44,20,'第3课——动词词性 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/1d0c87f7804e480d85503f22513ae292.pdf\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/7a865411d0e540998ca15490582551b5.docx\"]','','{\"1\": {\"answer\": \"1.vi. 2. vt. 3. vi. 4. vi. 5. vt. 6. vi. 7. vi. 8. vt. 9. vt. 10. vi.\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2\": {\"answer\": \"1.is 2. has 3. Does 4. doesn\'t 5. kept 6. feels\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"3\": {\"answer\": \"1.形容词 2. 代词 3. 数词 4. 形容词 5. 副词 6. 介词\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4\": {\"answer\": \"1.形容词：干净的2.动词：离开3.动词：浇水4.名词：糖果 / 形容词：甜的\\n5.动词：正在学习 / 名词：书房6.动词：抛弃7.动词：录音\\n8.名词：权利9.名词：集市10.形容词：合理的、可靠的\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(1)\": {\"answer\": \"第一步：is reading\\n第二步：主语 The young student / 宾语 an interesting book\\n第三步：young→student；interesting→book；Chinese→history\\n翻译：这位来自北京的年轻学生正在读一本关于中国历史的有趣的书。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(2)\": {\"answer\": \"第一步：bought、chose\\n第二步：分句1 主语 My mother / 宾语 a beautiful dress；分句2 主语 my sister / 宾语 a pair of comfortable shoes\\n第三步：beautiful→dress；comfortable→shoes\\n翻译：我妈妈在商场买了一条漂亮的裙子，但我妹妹选了一双舒适的鞋。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-15 21:00:00','2026-07-16 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:37:09','2026-07-08 16:02:21',58),(45,19,'第2课——词语 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/252d12f4855045e2b1894b2f98c57f63.docx\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/49cb6b4e86404aea9f969a00dab717e8.docx\"]','','{\"1\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"2\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"3\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"4\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"5\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"6\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"7\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"8\": {\"answer\": \"①“重重叠叠”形容一层又一层地摞在一起的样子，比“重叠”表达的数量更多，更能凸显葱茏的绿意。②“娇娇俏俏”意为柔美俊俏，比“娇俏”更能描摹荷花当时柔美娇羞的状态。③“柔柔弱弱”比“柔弱”表示的程度深，更能表现其他花娇小、令人怜惜的特点，凸显荷花的“娇羞、俏皮”，更让人心动。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 3}, \"9\": {\"answer\": \"(示例一)可以使用。理由：从表意上看，“养病”是因患病而休养，这是约定俗成的习惯表达。\\n(示例二)不合逻辑。理由：从结构上看，“养”与“病”是动宾关系，“病”是需要“治”的，不是需要“养”的。\\n解析　首先要表明态度，可以回答“可以使用”，也可以回答“不合逻辑”，然后从表意和结构这两方面阐述理由即可。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"10\": {\"answer\": \"(示例一)可以使用，属于超常搭配。理由：①“种植”本义是指在土地上培植植物，使其生长和繁殖，突破习惯的修饰与搭配。②化抽象为具体，“喜怒哀乐”原本是无形的，表现了人们从容坦荡的胸怀和冷静的态度。③与后文照应，语意衔接紧密。\\n(示例二)不合语言逻辑。理由：①“种植”一词后面一般与表示“实物”的名词搭配，如种植树木，这里却与抽象性词语搭配。②“种植”虽是带有明显主观色彩的动词，在生活里有意种植“喜乐”尚可，种植“哀怒”不符合人的真实情感。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"11\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"12\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"13\": {\"answer\": \"(示例)①不解之缘　②秘而不宣/秘而不露\\n③在所难免/屡见不鲜/数见不鲜/不胜枚举\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 3}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-14 21:00:00','2026-07-15 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:39:58','2026-07-08 09:38:41',43),(46,19,'第3课——短语（一） 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/eca0d2b39fa24f53b21239d41210f182.docx\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/9db3e00683784a2c85b413c5d466c262.docx\"]','','{\"1\": {\"answer\": \"①成语：不求甚解；②构成：“不求”和“甚解”都是偏正结构（或：“不求”是状中结构，“甚解”是定中结构）；③短语类型：动宾短语。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 3}, \"2\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"3\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"4\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"5\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"6\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"7\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"8\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"9\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"10\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"11\": {\"answer\": \"C\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"12\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"13\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"14\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"15\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-15 21:00:00','2026-07-16 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:41:19','2026-07-08 09:38:02',44),(47,19,'第4课——短语（二） 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/6097bce03dea4aefa45f9b6ec4552e39.docx\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/16b5e1cb12fc424cbcf76f0b7b6d6c1d.docx\"]','','{\"1\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"2\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"3\": {\"answer\": \"A\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 3}, \"4\": {\"answer\": \"并列短语  |   动宾短语   |  偏正短语  |  主谓短语    补充短语\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5\": {\"answer\": \"A\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"6\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"7\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"8\": {\"answer\": \"D\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"9\": {\"answer\": \"A\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"10\": {\"answer\": \"追求个人体验   |  需求升级\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-16 21:00:00','2026-07-17 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:42:07','2026-07-08 09:43:42',45),(48,19,'第5课——单句 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/a935440bd67b4b7c8fc4cad7427b9a3d.docx\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/9a699d658a8f4a19bdfe98a7820c6e19.docx\"]','','{\"1\": {\"answer\": \"A\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"2\": {\"answer\": \"A\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"3\": {\"answer\": \"B\", \"type\": \"option_letter\", \"score\": 2}, \"7\": {\"answer\": \"真的、善的、美的东西总是同假的、恶的、丑的东西相比较而存在的。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"8\": {\"answer\": \"整个团队按照规划开始了巨浪一号的研制攻关：第一步在陆上发射台发射导弹，第二步把导弹装进发射筒以模拟水下发射环境，第三步进行潜艇发射。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(1)\": {\"answer\": \"共产党员和革命分子,拿起，武器\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(2)\": {\"answer\": \"获得冠军是，心愿\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(3)\": {\"answer\": \"风雪\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(4)\": {\"answer\": \"小华成绩过硬是全班同学公认的\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(5)\": {\"answer\": \"我，看见许多人\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(6)\": {\"answer\": \"我，他的对于我热情的希望，不倦的教诲，小而言之，是为中国，就是希望中国有新的医学；大而言之，是为学术，就是希望新的医学传到中国去。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(7)\": {\"answer\": \"我们，学会，东西\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(8)\": {\"answer\": \"共产党员，不要忘记，责任\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(1)\": {\"answer\": \"西起九江（不含），东至江阴，||均是人民解放军的渡江区域。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(2)\": {\"answer\": \"在一天夜里，他||被一陈尖叫声惊醒了。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(3)\": {\"answer\": \"纽约市通常辉煌通明的帝国大厦||今晚熄灭了灯光。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(4)\": {\"answer\": \"袁隆平视为生命的四分田地，||在一个星期天的早晨，还是被那些造反派扫荡一空。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(5)\": {\"answer\": \"在这样的年月里，我家||通年没吃过白米。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(6)\": {\"answer\": \"他||花了十多年的时间，留意观察日、月以及各行星的运动。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(7)\": {\"answer\": \"我们的祖国||给科学开辟了广阔的前途。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(8)\": {\"answer\": \"她||教给了我生活的知识和革命的道理。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(9)\": {\"answer\": \"我们中华民族||有悠久的历史和优秀的文化传统。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5(10)\": {\"answer\": \"这支部队的先头连||就匆匆占领了汽车路边一个很低的光光的小山冈。\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"6(1)\": {\"answer\": \"孩子成才是，希望\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"6(2)\": {\"answer\": \"研制模仿人，自动机器，有，历史\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"6(3)\": {\"answer\": \"我觉得，战士，伟大\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"6(4)\": {\"answer\": \"习惯，态度，留有，印象\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"6(5)\": {\"answer\": \"卢沟桥修建\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-17 21:00:00','2026-07-18 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:43:28','2026-07-08 09:55:14',46),(49,20,'第4课——构词法 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/cb04a8ba9cc3437c9689713307ed1edd.pdf\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/505c5a27d27043e38cb2c168ec38ea58.docx\"]','','{\"2\": {\"answer\": \"1. 动词：复述、重述\\n   2. 名词：雇员、员工\\n   3. 形容词：无尽的、无穷的\\n   4. 形容词：不可改变的\\n   5. 动词/名词：交换、互换\\n   6. 动词：使...处于危险中\\n   7. 形容词：难以忘怀的\\n   8. 名词：准备\\n   9. 动词：确保、保证\\n   10. 形容词：富有成果的、丰硕的\\n   11. 形容词：可怜的、令人同情的\\n   12. 名词：丑陋\\n   13. 名词：懒惰\\n   14. 形容词：头脑简单的、单纯的\\n   15. 形容词：不恰当的、不合适的\\n   16. 名词：邀请\\n   17. 形容词：后悔的、遗憾的\\n   18. 名词：发展\\n   19. 名词：管理\\n   20. 形容词：不可避免的\\n   21. 名词：描述\\n   22. 动词：使现代化\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"3\": {\"answer\": \"1. noisily 2. players 3. happily 4. heavily 5. inventor / inventions\\n   6. foreigners 7. satisfactory 8. simplify 9. appearance 10. discovered\\n   11. operation 12. musician 13. honesty 14. boiling 15. kindness 16. expenses\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(1)\": {\"answer\": \"形容词→副词\\n   1. politely；rudely；immediately\\n   2. easily；angrily；happily；shyly\\n   3. possibly；probably；simply\\n   4. truly；duly；wholly\\n   5. basically；scientifically；publicly\\n   6. fully；dully\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(2)\": {\"answer\": \"名词与形容词的转换\\n   1. original；personal；national\\n   2. cultural；agricultural\\n   3. physical；mathematical\\n   4. western；southern；northern\\n   5. horrible；terrible\\n   6. careful；powerful；beautiful\\n   7. selfish；childish\\n   8. humorous；anxious\\n   9. significant；brilliant\\n   10. silent；different；patient\\n   11. frequent；efficient\\n   12. timely；monthly；daily\\n   13. responsibility；possibility\\n   14. sleepy；wealthy；noisy；sunny；foggy；tasty\\n   15. kindness；happiness\\n   16. warmth；truth\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(3)\": {\"answer\": \"动词→名词\\n   1. presentation；explanation\\n   2. preparation；pronunciation\\n   3. introduction；description\\n   4. pollution；contribution\\n   5. attraction；protection；suggestion\\n   6. conclusion；division\\n   7. performance；guidance\\n   8. preference；reference；difference\\n   9. agreement；development\\n   10. survival；refusal\\n   11. pressure；departure；mixture\\n   12. discovery\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(4)\": {\"answer\": \"名词/形容词→动词\\n   1. strengthen；deepen；weaken\\n   2. enable；enlarge；encourage\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(5)\": {\"answer\": \"动词/名词→表示人的名词\\n   1. teacher；stranger；villager\\n   2. inventor；educator；visitor\\n   3. employee；interviewee\\n   4. waitress；hostess；goddess\\n   5. physician；politician\\n   6. novelist；tourist；scientist\\n   7. accountant；consultant\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(6)\": {\"answer\": \"动词与形容词的转换\\n   1. comfortable；reasonable；admirable；reliable\\n   2. harmful；hopeful；careful；useful\\n   3. attractive；impressive；creative\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"1(7)\": {\"answer\": \"表示否定的前缀与后缀\\n   1. disagree\\n   2. 其他：unhappy；impossible；incorrect；nonstop；illegal；impatient；irregular；dislike；dishonest；unknown\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-16 21:00:00','2026-07-17 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:44:33','2026-07-08 16:41:27',66),(50,20,'第5课——句子成分1 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/06de3a3ebfa54a929f86d8c46354f574.pdf\"]','