, \"score\": 2}, \"4(2)\": {\"answer\": \"a new bike | me\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(3)\": {\"answer\": \"us | history\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(4)\": {\"answer\": \"the pen | Tom\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4(5)\": {\"answer\": \"any message | me\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-20 21:00:00','2026-07-21 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:44:57','2026-07-09 01:32:31',62),(52,19,'第7课——病句标志（一） 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/72d0f6e5932d4be88d78654ce45cc16b.docx\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/04b0488b9f5b43d6842edc193c10c6c9.docx\"]','','{\"1\": {\"answer\": \"语意不明，“他”指代的是“监场老师”还是“考生”并不确定\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2\": {\"answer\": \"重复，“为此”就是“由于这次交通事故”\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"3\": {\"answer\": \"宾语中心语残缺，“喂猪”后应加“的经验”\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"4\": {\"answer\": \"“达到”的宾语中心语残缺，“损失”后加“的目的”\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"5\": {\"answer\": \"“诸”即“之于”，“于”与它重复\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"6\": {\"answer\": \"“堪”即“可以”，“可以”与它重复\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"7\": {\"answer\": \"“由衷”即有“在心里”的意思，重复\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"8\": {\"answer\": \"语意不明，“修伞的”可能是“修伞的顾客”也可能是“修伞的师傅”\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"9\": {\"answer\": \"搭配不当，误用“的”字，偷换主语，造成“灯火”与“雄伟壮丽”不搭配，应删去“的”字\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"10\": {\"answer\": \"语序不当，应将“新出土的”调至“八千年前”\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"11\": {\"answer\": \"“能否”是两面性的词语，与后面不一致\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"12\": {\"answer\": \"“担心”“不会”，不合逻辑\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"13\": {\"answer\": \"“防止”“不再发生”，不合情理，应去掉“不”\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"14\": {\"answer\": \"“忌”或“不可”去其一\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"15\": {\"answer\": \"是“20日之前去”还是“20日这一天去”，语意不明\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"16\": {\"answer\": \"是“新同学”还是“新生命”，语意不明\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"17\": {\"answer\": \"“没有”兼有副词和动词的性质，造成语意不明\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"18\": {\"answer\": \"是“看不到”还是“瞧不起”，语意不明\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"19\": {\"answer\": \"大约”与“上下”重复\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"20\": {\"answer\": \"“几个”修饰有歧义\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"21\": {\"answer\": \"语句：①；“只能望其项背”修改为“难以望其项背”。(2)语句：⑥；“促使”修改为“导致”或者“使得”。(3)语句：⑨；“虽然”修改为“但是”\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}}','auto','pending',0,'2026-07-21 21:00:00','2026-07-22 01:00:00','published','2026-07-07 08:44:58','2026-07-08 15:05:52',48),(53,20,'第7课——简单句与并列句 作业','','[\"/uploads/homework/questions/d8dee27440a144d6a8f8e75758853619.pdf\"]','[\"/uploads/homework/answers/588a63d63db24be6975e622153d46434.docx\"]','','{\"1\": {\"answer\": \"1-5 ABCBE     6-10 CDEBD\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(1)\": {\"answer\": \"to be\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(2)\": {\"answer\": \"stay\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(3)\": {\"answer\": \"to finish\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(4)\": {\"answer\": \"to try\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(5)\": {\"answer\": \"crying\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(6)\": {\"answer\": \"sing\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(7)\": {\"answer\": \"to give up\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(8)\": {\"answer\": \"(to) carry\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(9)\": {\"answer\": \"not to make\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"2(10)\": {\"answer\": \"repair\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"3(1)\": {\"answer\": \"The teacher explained the problem. (S+V+O)\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"3(2)\": {\"answer\": \"My neighbor gave my sister a gift. (S+V+O+O)\", \"type\": \"fill_blank\", \"score\": 2}, \"3(3)\": {\"answer\": \"The boy looks happy. (S+V+P)\", \"type\"